	"title"		"原版化学扩展 / Vanilla Chemistry Expansion"
	"description"		"For questions regarding chemical reactions, item crafting, or bug reports, we recommend that you first consult or use the discussion forum.

2026/11/13 update: antibiotics are in, with strain breeding, gene mutation and drug resistance.
Cartel Vendor: the mod's machines, handbook, strains and seeds are all sold by the Cartel Vendor, who first comes on day 5 and then every 7 days.

You can buy alcohol, but you can't brew your own bootleg?
Pumping out 2000 Dream Dust a day, and not even Wilde at level 3 plus Intimidating can keep you out of trouble?
Droppers and measuring cylinders all over the bench, yet the only way to pure acid and base is fish?
All you can do with nuclear waste is dump it at the junkyard, where it feels like nothing and someone just picks it back up?

Inspired by real chemical production, this mod gives vanilla chemistry more to do, so late game you can really play the chemist through (somewhat) involved chemistry.

Main features:
0.1. Antibiotics: make antibiotics from strains, mutate their genes with chemicals, breed a super strain and fight drug resistance.
1. Brine electrolysis: electrolyse brine from GP Mining rock salt into base, hydrogen and chlorine; burn the gases into hydrogen chloride and dissolve it into acid. Pure acid and base in bulk. Purifying acid with fish never felt right, did it?
2. Hollow's Lantern: grow a lab-bred chili and refine a legal riot-control incapacitant. Sell it to the Upper Level or Security and your crimes disappear; once they are gone, the investigation slows too.
(Did nobody catch the Outer Wilds nod? 😭)
3. Dream Toxin: the legal product of Dream Caps, a high-end cosmetic treatment for the Upper Level.
4. Possibly the new ice: grow Xinke and make high-profit new ice that isn't medical. It brings a regular back the next day, whose budget grows 25% a day.
5. Blend nutrifruit, brew beer with acid and yeast, and serve chilled draft beer!
6. Make alcohol from starch and sugar, ethyl acetate from plant matter, and edit genes so other crops make sugar and starch. Deep-space wine merchant: probably blended.
7. Crush ore and use the minerals to purify the acid and base the profiteers sell you.
8. Neutralize nuclear waste, extract the plutonium, and make Nuclear Cola!
9. Cartel expansion, beta 0.5:
[list][*]Any start can join the cartel. Sell too much chemical contraband and the cartel takes notice.
[*]Work with Security to bring the cartel down!
[*]Plenty of cartel mechanics.
[*]Still in testing, so it is off by default in the mod settings.[/list]The cartel storyline (spoilers!): [url=https://github.com/Wladyslavv/Vanilla_Chemistry_Expansion]GitHub[/url]
More chemistry is planned; I just need a little inspiration.
Gunsmiths may also want: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3831394883]Ammo Printer[/url]

[h2]Vanilla Chemistry Expansion[/h2]Built on the vanilla chemistry system (extraction, heating, refrigeration, filtering, evaporation, pressing); vanilla products and reactions are unchanged.

[h3]Dream Toxin (handbook chapter 1)[/h3]A legal medical outlet for Dream Caps and Nightmare Caps.
[list][*]Mix the two extracts 1:1 with a little acid and chill it in a fridge; burn off leftover extract, filter, dry and press [b]Dream Toxin Injectors[/b].
[*]Popular with Upper Level cosmetic clinics; a legal medical item, base value 150. Only pharma grade (90%+) pays: about street Dream Dust money, without the notoriety.[/list][h3]Brine electrolysis (new, handbook chapter 10)[/h3]A simplified chlor-alkali process: 1 part salt + 0.3 part water ends up as 1 part base and 1 part acid, both free of chemical contaminant and heavy metal.

[h3]Hollow's Lantern and Incapacitant (handbook chapter 9)[/h3]A lab-bred chili, and the legal riot-control agent refined from it.
[list][*][b]Hollow's Lantern[/b]: annual, innate Capsaicin Production III gene, spliceable into other crops. The Cartel Vendor brings two seeds each visit.
[*]Blend for capsaicin, add at least 4x the alcohol and heat to 50-78°C for Lantern Ester (too little alcohol leaves physical contaminant); filter, evaporate the alcohol and press [b]A Small Vial of Incapacitant[/b].
[*][b]Wiping your record[/b]: each vial sold to the Upper Level or Security takes price × purity × 5 off your crimes; once those are cleared, every full 100 left takes 1 off investigation progress.[/list][h3]Xinke and Crackine (handbook chapter 8)[/h3]A new crop, and the new ice refined from the alkaloid in its leaves. No medical tag: raw leaves earn less than Dream Dust, refined Crackine a little more.
[list][*][b]Xinke[/b]: perennial, drought-tolerant, no replanting after picking. Innate Alkaloid Production gene, spliceable into other crops. The Cartel Vendor brings seeds; the shady farmer sells leaves.
[*]Blend the leaves, remove the protein, add acid, boil dry, drive off leftover acid in the evaporator and press [b]Crackine[/b] (a small vial ≈ 1.5 Dream Dust; a large one = four small).
[*][b]Regulars[/b]: a personal-use buyer who gets 90%+ Crackine comes back the next day; each daily visit after that adds 25% to their budget (up to 2000), with special lines.[/list][h3]Ore chemistry: purifying acid and base (handbook chapter 2)[/h3]No filter removes the chemical contaminant and heavy metal in vanilla acid and base, which keeps drugs from lab-pure grade.
[list][*]Crush metal ore in a [b]blender with all 4 chem modules[/b] for calcite and quartz sand.
[*][b]Purifying base[/b]: calcine calcite into quicklime and add it to base to remove the chemical contaminant; heavy metal settles out on its own. Filter.
[*][b]Purifying acid[/b]: quartz sand and base make water glass; add acid to precipitate silica gel. Heated silica gel drives the contaminant out of acid; freezing removes heavy metal. Filter.
[*]Needs an upgraded heating plate.[/list][h3]Starch genes[/h3]Nutrifruit's starch and sugar now come from innate Starch and Sugar Production genes: same totals, spliceable into other crops.

[h3]Industrial alcohol (handbook chapter 3)[/h3][list][*]Blend nutrifruit, hydrolyse the starch into sugar with acid and heat, neutralize, add yeast: alcohol by morning. Each yeast tolerates a different strength.
[*]Boil off the methanol; freeze and filter out ice to concentrate to about 25%.
[*]The chem scanner shows a container's temperature; mod settings adjust boiling, fermentation and fridge cooling speed.[/list][h3]Blended wine (handbook chapters 3 and 4)[/h3][list][*]Dry-distil plant matter into acetic acid, esterify it with alcohol into ethyl acetate, then press it with alcohol and water into wine.
[*]A labeller sets two labels: quality and method (genuine/blended). Lying is risky: unnoticed sales add up to fraud, and Upper Level clients refuse blended wine.[/list][h3]Beer (handbook chapters 5 and 6)[/h3][list][*]The Chem Finisher fills weak nutrifruit brew into a 2 L [b]Beer Keg[/b], graded premium, ordinary or undrinkable; dilute with good or pure water for premium.
[*]Double-click the keg to pour one: a [b]can of beer[/b] at room temperature, [b]draft beer[/b] once chilled. Draft sells best but goes flat overnight.
[*]Beer counts as water: water buyers take it too.[/list][h3]Advanced Kotton fabric[/h3]A gold Kotton fabric that regains full durability every day, found wherever the vanilla advanced water filter is.

[h3]Nuclear waste reprocessing (handbook chapter 7)[/h3][list][*]Pry a barrel open with a crowbar, dissolve the spent fuel in strong acid, add reducing agent, extract the plutonium with ethyl acetate, boil dry and fill [b]Plutonium Ampoules[/b].
[*]An ampoule dragged onto a drink makes a Nuclear drink worth +50; only Upper Level clients and addicts buy it.
[*]Vitrify the leftover fission products with water glass.
[*][b]Radiation sickness[/b]: nuclear waste left unprocessed overnight lowers your selling prices; genuine Immunivax eases it.
[*]A Waste Broker comes every 7 days from day 7, selling nuclear waste.[/list]"
	"changenote"		"1.8.1: Adds a Russian translation (thanks to BackAndDead) and polished handbook wording (thanks to 丧心). The handbook has coloured bookmark tabs on its right edge, one per chapter, that jump straight to it, and the antibiotics chapter gains a strain trait table. Antibiotics: a strain now blends into half as much cephalosporin C (three tablets instead of six), and tablets have a base price of 60 instead of 100. Tablets can be blended in a livestock feed dispenser; that night every diseased animal in the cage is cured. Fixed resistance never setting in: sales were not being counted. Pouring, filtering or pipetting cephalosporin C now carries its genome, purity trait and extraction target with it; before, tablets pressed after filtering lost all three. Natural genome mutation lowered from 5% to 0.5% per offspring. A fermenter batch spanning several nights no longer restarts when a save is loaded, and its tooltip shows the power it actually draws. Cartel: the courier delivers a 20-bottle pack of each chemical (acid, base and alcohol 250, the others 500), double-click to unpack. Cartel merchants halve the evidence from contraband sales, like the black market. The Peer's supply crates are no longer empty. The Cartel Network phone menu is paged, so all six products can be ordered. Filters (Kotton fabric, water filters, hydroreed filter) keep what they catch; drag one onto a container or the drain to empty it. Handbook fixes: acetic acid and alcohol react 1:1 to ethyl acetate; acetic acid can be made from any plant matter; the nuclear waste steps say where ethyl acetate and water glass are made; the ore chemistry purification steps are reworded. / 1.8.1：新增俄语翻译（感谢 BackAndDead），手册文字经过润色（感谢 丧心）。手册右侧新增彩色书签，每章一枚，点击直接翻到该章；抗生素章节新增菌种性状表。抗生素：每支菌种打碎得到的头孢菌素 C 减半（压成 3 片而不是 6 片），药片基础价从 100 降到 60。抗生素片可以放进饲料分配器打碎，当晚治好同笼所有患病牲畜。修复抗药性从不触发：销售额此前没有被记录。倾倒、过滤或用滴管转移头孢菌素 C 时，基因组、纯度性状和萃取目标会跟着液体走；以前过滤后压出的药片这三项全部丢失。菌种自然突变出新基因组的概率从每代 5% 降到 0.5%。跨多晚的发酵批次读档后不再从头开始，发酵罐的提示也改为显示实际耗电。卡特尔：快递员改送每种化学品 20 瓶装的整包（酸、碱、酒精 250，其余 500），双击拆开。卡特尔商人收购违禁品时增加的证据减半，与黑市相同。同行商人的物资箱不再是空的。卡特尔网络的电话菜单改为分页，六种商品都能订到。棉织物、滤水器等过滤器会留住滤下的东西，拖到容器或下水口上即可倒出。手册修正：乙酸与酒精按 1:1 生成乙酸乙酯；任何植物原料都能干馏出乙酸；核废料步骤注明了乙酸乙酯和水玻璃的制法出处；矿石化学的提纯步骤重写了措辞。"
}
